        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door transit time for a car shipped from Ernakulam to Lucknow ranges between 4 to 6 business days, depending on traffic conditions, weather, and any mandatory checkpoints along the national highway corridors. Our real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress and receive updates throughout the journey.</p>
