        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a three‑layer protection protocol: (1) hydraulic ramp loading eliminates manual lifts, (2) a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system cushions the vehicle, and (3) each carrier is equipped with anti‑vibration mounts and GPS‑monitored secure lashing. Together these measures ensure a scratch‑free delivery.</p>
