        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are insurance options available for my vehicle during the Ernakulam‑Lucknow transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance offering 100 % declared value protection. Customers can also opt for additional third‑party coverage for peace of mind. Our team will provide the insurance certificate and claim procedure before dispatch.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for interstate car shipping between Ernakulam and Lucknow?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The mandatory paperwork includes a valid vehicle registration certificate, original insurance policy, PAN‑linked GST invoice, signed transport agreement, e‑Way bill generated through the GST portal, and a copy of the driver’s licence. Our logistics coordinator assists you in preparing each document to avoid delays.</p>
