        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our carrier trucks are fitted with satellite‑based GPS units that feed live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link via email and SMS, allowing you to view the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations instantly.</p>
