        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are costs calculated for car transport services from Ernakulam to Lucknow?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on vehicle size, weight, distance, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special handling requirements such as high‑value or vintage cars. We also factor in tolls and state taxes. A transparent quotation breaks down each component, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
