        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our standard offering includes door‑to‑door pickup in Ernakulam, secure loading at our dedicated depot, interstate transit, and final delivery to the exact address in Lucknow. We coordinate with you for convenient timing, provide pre‑delivery inspection, and obtain your signature upon successful handover.</p>
